WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.234 --> 00:00:03.467
-The president
of the United States

00:00:03.467 --> 00:00:04.868
stole classified documents,
which were then

00:00:04.868 --> 00:00:06.834
copied onto a private laptop

00:00:06.834 --> 00:00:09.400
while he and a close
family member made money

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:11.300
off their dealings
with a foreign government.

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:13.634
Wow, this is a damning story

00:00:13.634 --> 00:00:15.601
for President Biden
and his son, Hunter.

00:00:15.601 --> 00:00:16.767
Oh, what's that?

00:00:16.767 --> 00:00:20.767
It's about Donald Trump
and Jared Kushner?

00:00:20.767 --> 00:00:23.534
Well, no, just
thank God you told me, alright?

00:00:23.534 --> 00:00:25.634
Because the next
cue card says, "I'm sorry,

00:00:25.634 --> 00:00:27.100
Marjorie Taylor Greene,
you were right,

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:30.400
and you deserve my utmost
admiration and respect."

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:31.634
You know what, Wally?

00:00:31.634 --> 00:00:32.601
Can you get rid of
that cue card?

00:00:32.601 --> 00:00:34.200
-Yeah, sure thing, Seth.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.934
[ Laughter ]

00:00:35.934 --> 00:00:37.067
-That was aggressive, Wally.

00:00:37.067 --> 00:00:38.501
You could have just
thrown it out.

00:00:38.501 --> 00:00:39.634
-Sorry, Seth.

00:00:39.634 --> 00:00:41.801
I bet a lot of money
on the Eagles last week.

00:00:41.801 --> 00:00:44.367
Luckily, I just made it all back
by appearing on camera.

00:00:44.367 --> 00:00:46.200
-Okay.

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:48.300
Gotcha.

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:51.200
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:52.567
Do you want a minute
to catch your breath?

00:00:52.567 --> 00:00:53.767
Too bad!

00:00:53.767 --> 00:00:55.100
For more on this,
is time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:59.100
♪♪

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:01.267
Before we get to
the investigation of Trump's

00:01:01.267 --> 00:01:02.601
stolen classified documents,

00:01:02.601 --> 00:01:04.634
there was big news in another
Trump investigation,

00:01:04.634 --> 00:01:05.834
the one looking into

00:01:05.834 --> 00:01:07.601
potential election interference
in Georgia.

00:01:07.601 --> 00:01:08.901
The district attorney

00:01:08.901 --> 00:01:11.067
has already said charges
could be imminent.

00:01:11.067 --> 00:01:13.868
And last year, she informed
ex-Trump lawyer Rudy Giuliani,

00:01:13.868 --> 00:01:15.834
that he was a target
of the investigation.

00:01:15.834 --> 00:01:19.434
Well, today, a judge released
parts of the grand jury's report

00:01:19.434 --> 00:01:21.267
from that investigation,
which revealed

00:01:21.267 --> 00:01:23.667
that the jurors found evidence
of possible crimes

00:01:23.667 --> 00:01:25.334
and even
recommended indictments.

00:01:25.334 --> 00:01:27.267
-Breaking news from Georgia,
moments ago,

00:01:27.267 --> 00:01:28.634
a judge in
Fulton County, Georgia,

00:01:28.634 --> 00:01:30.200
released parts of a report

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:31.767
submitted
by a special grand jury

00:01:31.767 --> 00:01:34.634
investigating efforts by
Trump and his allies

00:01:34.634 --> 00:01:37.267
to overturn
his 2020 election loss.

00:01:37.267 --> 00:01:39.200
-In it, the grand jurors
write that they believe

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:40.634
that at least one witness

00:01:40.634 --> 00:01:43.033
may have perjured
him or herself,

00:01:43.033 --> 00:01:44.734
and they encourage the D.A.

00:01:44.734 --> 00:01:46.934
to seek
appropriate remedy there,

00:01:46.934 --> 00:01:49.400
presumably in the form
of an indictment.

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:51.300
-Now, we don't know
who they're talking about

00:01:51.300 --> 00:01:53.434
and we can't guess,
but when I saw that news,

00:01:53.434 --> 00:01:54.501
this is the face I made.

00:01:55.667 --> 00:01:59.501
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.601 --> 00:02:03.734
We'll have to wait for the rest
of the grand jury report

00:02:03.734 --> 00:02:04.934
and the DA's final decision

00:02:04.934 --> 00:02:06.601
before we can draw
any more conclusions.

00:02:06.601 --> 00:02:08.601
But oddly, that's not
the investigation

00:02:08.601 --> 00:02:10.367
Republicans are
interested in right now.

00:02:10.367 --> 00:02:13.033
Instead, they've been laser
focused on basically one thing,

00:02:13.033 --> 00:02:14.501
and that's
Hunter Biden's laptop.

00:02:14.501 --> 00:02:17.267
It's been a nonstop obsession
on right wing media,

00:02:17.267 --> 00:02:19.767
and the new Republican majority
even held a hearing about it

00:02:19.767 --> 00:02:21.434
as one of their
first acts in power.

00:02:21.434 --> 00:02:25.400
-Big media suppressed the truth

00:02:25.400 --> 00:02:27.601
about the Hunter Biden
laptop story.

00:02:27.601 --> 00:02:30.501
-He may have collaborated with
the U.S. intelligence community

00:02:30.501 --> 00:02:33.601
regarding stories that y'all
didn't want the public to see.

00:02:33.601 --> 00:02:36.534
So, namely, what we refer to as
the Hunter Biden laptop story.

00:02:36.534 --> 00:02:38.300
-We're gonna go into
Hunter Biden's laptop.

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:39.834
-There's a lot in that laptop.

00:02:39.834 --> 00:02:42.300
-FBI subpoenaed
Hunter Biden's laptop...

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:44.234
-Regarding
Hunter Biden's laptop...

00:02:44.234 --> 00:02:46.267
-Hunter Biden's laptop.
-Hunter Biden's laptop.

00:02:46.267 --> 00:02:48.067
-Hunter Biden's laptop.
-Hunter Biden's laptop.

00:02:48.067 --> 00:02:49.601
-Hunter Biden laptop.
-Hunter Biden laptop.

00:02:49.601 --> 00:02:52.033
-Hunter Biden laptop.
-Hunter Biden laptop.

00:02:52.033 --> 00:02:54.067
-The laptop from Hell, right?

00:02:54.067 --> 00:02:57.467
-I haven't seen anyone
this obsessed with a laptop

00:02:57.467 --> 00:02:59.300
since my childhood friend
found porn

00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:01.734
on his dad's Toshiba T1100.

00:03:01.734 --> 00:03:02.801
[ Laughter ]

00:03:02.801 --> 00:03:04.934
We burned the hell
out of our thighs,

00:03:04.934 --> 00:03:06.501
but it was worth it.

00:03:06.501 --> 00:03:07.868
Very steamy.

00:03:07.868 --> 00:03:09.634
Also very slow.

00:03:09.634 --> 00:03:14.167
"Did someone order...

00:03:14.167 --> 00:03:15.601
a pizza?"

00:03:15.601 --> 00:03:17.033
[ Laughter ]

00:03:17.033 --> 00:03:19.067
Seriously,
the last time a bunch of people

00:03:19.067 --> 00:03:21.033
freaked out
this much over a computer

00:03:21.033 --> 00:03:24.334
was when Bill Gates
launched Windows 95.

00:03:24.334 --> 00:03:26.167
Took 25 years,

00:03:26.167 --> 00:03:27.868
but Bill Gates finally
got off the hook

00:03:27.868 --> 00:03:31.467
as world's worst dancer.

00:03:31.467 --> 00:03:33.334
Dude looks like he's trying
to wriggle his way

00:03:33.334 --> 00:03:34.968
out of a straitjacket.

00:03:34.968 --> 00:03:38.701
"I'm not crazy.
I just gotta boogie."

00:03:38.701 --> 00:03:41.334
Also, why does Trump call it
"the laptop from Hell"?

00:03:41.334 --> 00:03:42.934
He's never used a computer
in his life.

00:03:42.934 --> 00:03:46.167
For Trump, any laptop would be
the laptop from Hell.

00:03:46.167 --> 00:03:47.534
If he ever saw Jason,

00:03:47.534 --> 00:03:50.100
he'd probably hear
the Apple startup chime.

00:03:50.100 --> 00:03:52.834
[ Startup chime ]

00:03:54.334 --> 00:03:55.968
Republicans have been
so obsessed

00:03:55.968 --> 00:03:57.868
with this laptop
that Congressman Matt Gaetz

00:03:57.868 --> 00:04:00.367
hijacked a congressional
oversight hearing last year

00:04:00.367 --> 00:04:02.767
that was supposed to be
about cybersecurity

00:04:02.767 --> 00:04:05.067
to relentlessly grill
a dude from the FBI

00:04:05.067 --> 00:04:07.100
about the location
of the laptop.

00:04:07.100 --> 00:04:08.901
-I want to know where
Hunter Biden's laptop is.

00:04:08.901 --> 00:04:10.400
Where is it?

00:04:10.400 --> 00:04:11.501
-Sir, I don't know that answer.

00:04:11.501 --> 00:04:13.334
-You're telling me right here

00:04:13.334 --> 00:04:16.133
is that as the assistant
director of FBI Cyber,

00:04:16.133 --> 00:04:17.934
you don't know where this is

00:04:17.934 --> 00:04:21.734
after it was turned over
to you three years ago?

00:04:21.734 --> 00:04:23.367
-Yes, sir.
That's an accurate statement.

00:04:23.367 --> 00:04:25.534
-Have you assessed whether or
not the Hunter Biden laptop

00:04:25.534 --> 00:04:28.801
gives Russia the ability
to harm our country?

00:04:28.801 --> 00:04:32.767
-Sir, again, we can do
this back and forth

00:04:32.767 --> 00:04:34.200
for the next couple of minutes.

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:38.167
I don't have any information
about the Hunter Biden laptop.

00:04:38.167 --> 00:04:39.400
-Do you even know who has it?

00:04:39.400 --> 00:04:40.634
Do you know who we should
put in that chair

00:04:40.634 --> 00:04:42.601
to ask these questions to?

00:04:42.601 --> 00:04:45.567
-No, sir.
I don't know who has it.

00:04:45.567 --> 00:04:47.767
-Well, could you find
out and tell us?

00:04:47.767 --> 00:04:51.334
-Sir, I'd be happy to take
your request back to our office.

00:04:51.334 --> 00:04:54.868
-Gosh, I mean, will you
advocate for that briefing?

00:04:54.868 --> 00:04:56.734
As -- You will?

00:04:56.734 --> 00:04:58.801
-I will be happy
to take your request

00:04:58.801 --> 00:05:01.167
back to FBI headquarters.

00:05:01.167 --> 00:05:03.501
-Well, will -- Do you believe
that that is a briefing

00:05:03.501 --> 00:05:07.234
that the Congress is
worthy of having, I guess?

00:05:07.234 --> 00:05:09.834
-Sir, I am not going to
answer that question.

00:05:09.834 --> 00:05:12.534
I'm here to talk in --

00:05:12.534 --> 00:05:17.434
The invitation says "oversight
of the FBI cyber division."

00:05:17.434 --> 00:05:19.367
-I've never seen
a congressional witness

00:05:19.367 --> 00:05:23.367
refer to that invitation
like that before.

00:05:23.367 --> 00:05:25.634
It's like when you get invited
to your weird aunt's wedding,

00:05:25.634 --> 00:05:27.534
only to realize
she's marrying the cat.

00:05:27.534 --> 00:05:29.667
"Oh, [bleep].

00:05:29.667 --> 00:05:31.300
Let me look at the invite.
Yeah.

00:05:31.300 --> 00:05:33.400
No, it says right here
'Mr. Whiskers.'

00:05:33.400 --> 00:05:35.200
That's not --

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:38.434
That's never been
a person's last name.'

00:05:38.434 --> 00:05:40.534
And the GOP's obsession
with Hunter's laptop

00:05:40.534 --> 00:05:41.801
has only gotten more intense

00:05:41.801 --> 00:05:43.467
with the revelation
that Joe Biden

00:05:43.467 --> 00:05:45.934
had some classified documents
from his time in the Senate

00:05:45.934 --> 00:05:48.434
and as vice president
at his home and private office.

00:05:48.434 --> 00:05:50.467
Even after Biden
turned over the documents

00:05:50.467 --> 00:05:52.634
and welcomed multiple
FBI searches of his properties,

00:05:52.634 --> 00:05:54.834
Republicans still want to know
if Hunter Biden

00:05:54.834 --> 00:05:57.601
specifically had access
to any of those documents.

00:05:57.601 --> 00:05:59.734
-Think about from
his own family,

00:05:59.734 --> 00:06:01.634
where Hunter Biden is involved.

00:06:01.634 --> 00:06:06.734
-Hunter's proximity, easy
access to classified material

00:06:06.734 --> 00:06:08.534
is a little bit more
than concerning.

00:06:08.534 --> 00:06:12.300
-Are we sure Hunter didn't get
a look at these documents

00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:16.434
or sell them to his business
partners in China or Ukraine?

00:06:16.434 --> 00:06:18.133
-It looks like Hunter Biden
was peddling

00:06:18.133 --> 00:06:19.968
classified documents for cash.

00:06:19.968 --> 00:06:24.834
-Hunter Biden had classified
information in his possession.

00:06:24.834 --> 00:06:29.234
-The FBI needs to search
the residences of Hunter Biden

00:06:29.234 --> 00:06:31.834
and any business offices
of Hunter Biden

00:06:31.834 --> 00:06:34.434
to determine if there are
classified materials there.

00:06:34.434 --> 00:06:37.367
-And I'm sure when the FBI got
Ted Cruz's request, they said...

00:06:37.367 --> 00:06:40.167
-I'd be happy to take
your request back to our office.

00:06:40.167 --> 00:06:42.334
[ Laughter ]

00:06:42.334 --> 00:06:43.734
-But clearly,

00:06:43.734 --> 00:06:45.467
based on the Republican
obsession with Hunter's laptop,

00:06:45.467 --> 00:06:48.267
they're afraid classified
documents could have been copied

00:06:48.267 --> 00:06:50.701
to a computer,
where they would be vulnerable

00:06:50.701 --> 00:06:52.901
to espionage
or influence peddling.

00:06:52.901 --> 00:06:55.434
And that fear turned out
to be totally justified --

00:06:55.434 --> 00:06:57.501
just not in the way
they were expecting.

00:06:57.501 --> 00:06:59.033
-More classified documents
found at

00:06:59.033 --> 00:07:01.467
former President Trump's
Mar-a-Lago home.

00:07:01.467 --> 00:07:04.400
Multiple sources telling CNN
that Trump's lawyers

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:06.601
turned over these documents
to federal prosecutors

00:07:06.601 --> 00:07:10.267
after they were found searching
through boxes at Mar-a-Lago.

00:07:10.267 --> 00:07:12.100
Now, apparently the documents
were also copied

00:07:12.100 --> 00:07:13.534
onto the laptop of a Trump aide.

00:07:13.534 --> 00:07:14.734
-Oh, my God.

00:07:14.734 --> 00:07:17.434
Classified documents
were found on a laptop.

00:07:17.434 --> 00:07:18.734
That can only mean one thing.

00:07:18.734 --> 00:07:19.868
It's...

00:07:19.868 --> 00:07:21.667
[ Voice echoing ]
...the laptop from Hell!

00:07:21.667 --> 00:07:23.968
[ Lightning crack ]

00:07:23.968 --> 00:07:25.067
[ Evil cackling ]

00:07:25.067 --> 00:07:26.300
-AOL Soundbite: You've got mail.

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:30.133
[ Laughter ]

00:07:30.133 --> 00:07:31.601
-That's right.

00:07:31.601 --> 00:07:34.767
After two years of nonstop
obsessing over Biden's laptop,

00:07:34.767 --> 00:07:37.901
someone on Donald Trump's team
reportedly had a laptop

00:07:37.901 --> 00:07:39.300
with classified documents on it.

00:07:39.300 --> 00:07:41.400
But here's the thing -- say what
you will about Republicans,

00:07:41.400 --> 00:07:43.234
they are consistent
in their outrage.

00:07:43.234 --> 00:07:46.167
So here's a long montage
we put together

00:07:46.167 --> 00:07:48.133
where Republicans
express concern over

00:07:48.133 --> 00:07:50.400
who had access
to these documents.

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:52.367
-♪ Never gonna give you up ♪

00:07:52.367 --> 00:07:55.100
-That's right,
we did a Rick Roll!

00:07:55.100 --> 00:07:57.467
A meme so old, I first saw it...

00:07:57.467 --> 00:08:00.801
[ Applause ]

00:08:00.801 --> 00:08:03.467
I first saw that on
my friend's dad's Toshiba.

00:08:03.467 --> 00:08:05.534
[ Laughter ]

00:08:05.534 --> 00:08:07.033
He called me recently,
by the way.

00:08:07.033 --> 00:08:09.033
He said he wanted his hair back.

00:08:11.367 --> 00:08:12.834
[ Light laughter ]

00:08:12.834 --> 00:08:15.200
So Trump has now turned over
more classified documents

00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:16.901
he apparently
withheld from the feds.

00:08:16.901 --> 00:08:18.133
Now, you might recall

00:08:18.133 --> 00:08:19.667
he recently defended
the discovery

00:08:19.667 --> 00:08:23.534
of some empty classified folders
as a "cool keepsake."

00:08:23.534 --> 00:08:25.534
But a lawyer for Trump
went on CNN this week

00:08:25.534 --> 00:08:27.400
with an even dumber explanation
for why

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:29.400
Trump had this stuff
in his possession.

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:32.434
-Now, you also turned over
an empty folder marked

00:08:32.434 --> 00:08:34.100
"classified" to investigators.

00:08:34.100 --> 00:08:36.601
Where was this folder
and why was it turned over?

00:08:36.601 --> 00:08:38.767
-It's a folder,
a manila folder that says

00:08:38.767 --> 00:08:42.100
"classified evening summary"
on it.

00:08:42.100 --> 00:08:44.667
And it was in
the president's bedroom.

00:08:44.667 --> 00:08:48.868
He has one of those landline
telephones next to his bed

00:08:48.868 --> 00:08:52.100
and it has a blue light on it,
and it keeps him up at night.

00:08:52.100 --> 00:08:54.400
So he took the manila folder
and he put it over it

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:56.367
so that it would keep
the light down

00:08:56.367 --> 00:08:57.501
so he could sleep at night.

00:08:57.501 --> 00:08:59.167
They demanded it back,

00:08:59.167 --> 00:09:01.667
and so now the president
has to find a different way

00:09:01.667 --> 00:09:03.534
to keep the blue light
out of his eyes.

00:09:03.534 --> 00:09:05.167
[ Laughter ]

00:09:05.167 --> 00:09:07.667
-Well, best of luck to him.

00:09:07.667 --> 00:09:08.901
That's right,

00:09:08.901 --> 00:09:11.300
Trump claims he kept
an empty classified folder

00:09:11.300 --> 00:09:13.100
as a way to cover a blue light
on the phone

00:09:13.100 --> 00:09:14.400
next to his bed
so he could sleep.

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:16.767
The guy's supposed to be
a billionaire real estate mogul,

00:09:16.767 --> 00:09:18.901
and he lives like
a hungover private detective

00:09:18.901 --> 00:09:20.300
from the '70s.

00:09:20.300 --> 00:09:21.667
Just drinking [bleep] beer

00:09:21.667 --> 00:09:23.634
in a trailer on the beach
with a gross, old dog.

00:09:23.634 --> 00:09:26.167
"Come on, Honcho. Bedtime.

00:09:26.167 --> 00:09:29.434
Now where's
that sleeping folder?"

00:09:29.434 --> 00:09:31.167
What other federal documents
is he using

00:09:31.167 --> 00:09:32.400
to fix [bleep] at his house?

00:09:32.400 --> 00:09:34.234
Did he patch up the screen door
on his patio

00:09:34.234 --> 00:09:37.334
with a copy of
the Declaration of Independence?

00:09:37.334 --> 00:09:39.167
Oh, I'm sorry,
I don't buy that

00:09:39.167 --> 00:09:40.968
he couldn't sleep
with a blue light next to him.

00:09:40.968 --> 00:09:43.501
This is a man
who stared directly at the sun

00:09:43.501 --> 00:09:45.400
during an eclipse.

00:09:45.400 --> 00:09:47.033
I doubt a blue light

00:09:47.033 --> 00:09:50.000
from a phone
can pierce his retinas.

00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:51.467
Also, I simply do not believe

00:09:51.467 --> 00:09:53.067
he sleeps
in pitch black darkness.

00:09:53.067 --> 00:09:55.434
He's definitely one of those
old guys who's got the TV

00:09:55.434 --> 00:09:57.234
blasting all night
with his iPhone

00:09:57.234 --> 00:09:59.267
right next to his face
at maximum brightness.

00:09:59.267 --> 00:10:01.133
When Trump walks
into his bedroom at night,

00:10:01.133 --> 00:10:03.100
I bet it's like Kramer
walking into his apartment

00:10:03.100 --> 00:10:05.200
when the chicken place
opened next door.

00:10:05.968 --> 00:10:07.234
[ Loud humming ]

00:10:07.234 --> 00:10:10.100
Now, as we've discussed
many times on this show,

00:10:10.100 --> 00:10:12.567
it's one thing
to have classified documents

00:10:12.567 --> 00:10:14.767
in your possession
and return them when asked.

00:10:14.767 --> 00:10:17.200
That's what Biden
and Mike Pence did,

00:10:17.200 --> 00:10:18.267
and it's not that big a deal.

00:10:18.267 --> 00:10:20.000
But Trump repeatedly lied,

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:22.000
defied a subpoena,
refused to give them back,

00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:23.567
and instructed
aides and lawyers to say

00:10:23.567 --> 00:10:25.467
he'd returned them all
when he hadn't.

00:10:25.467 --> 00:10:26.701
That's why he's being
investigated

00:10:26.701 --> 00:10:28.167
for obstruction of justice.

00:10:28.167 --> 00:10:30.934
And now the investigation has
reportedly gotten so serious,

00:10:30.934 --> 00:10:33.033
the special counsel leading
the investigation is trying

00:10:33.033 --> 00:10:36.767
to force one of Trump's lawyers
to testify again by suggesting

00:10:36.767 --> 00:10:38.701
Trump may have used
that lawyer to commit a crime.

00:10:38.701 --> 00:10:40.901
-We're learning that prosecutors
who were investigating

00:10:40.901 --> 00:10:42.767
Trump's handling
of classified documents

00:10:42.767 --> 00:10:46.334
are now seeking to compel one
of his attorneys to come back

00:10:46.334 --> 00:10:49.133
and testify
before the grand jury again.

00:10:49.133 --> 00:10:50.534
That attorney is Evan Corcoran.

00:10:50.534 --> 00:10:52.667
He's already testified
before the grand jury

00:10:52.667 --> 00:10:54.567
for about 4 hours or so,
I'm told.

00:10:54.567 --> 00:10:56.501
But they actually want him
to come back.

00:10:56.501 --> 00:10:58.634
And this time,
they are trying to overcome

00:10:58.634 --> 00:11:00.167
that attorney-client privilege

00:11:00.167 --> 00:11:03.000
that protects what he and Trump
have talked about privately.

00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:05.534
And in doing so,
they have written to the judge

00:11:05.534 --> 00:11:07.434
alleging that they believe

00:11:07.434 --> 00:11:12.467
Trump used Evan Corcoran in
furtherance of a crime or fraud.

00:11:12.467 --> 00:11:14.300
And that's a big deal --
prosecutors are basically

00:11:14.300 --> 00:11:15.934
saying that
attorney-client privilege

00:11:15.934 --> 00:11:18.400
shouldn't apply, because
the attorney in this case

00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:19.968
may have helped
Trump commit a crime.

00:11:19.968 --> 00:11:21.267
But I mean, come on,
that's ridiculous.

00:11:21.267 --> 00:11:22.767
When has one of Trump's lawyers
ever helped him

00:11:22.767 --> 00:11:23.834
do anything suspicious?

00:11:23.834 --> 00:11:26.767
Oh, right, I forgot Rudy,

00:11:26.767 --> 00:11:28.234
the guy who looks like
he just walked into

00:11:28.234 --> 00:11:30.767
Donald Trump's bedroom and was
blinded by the blue phone light.

00:11:30.767 --> 00:11:32.367
"Whoa!

00:11:35.167 --> 00:11:36.434
Boss, we need to cover that!

00:11:36.434 --> 00:11:40.000
How about we steal
the Mona Lisa from the Louvre?

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:43.067
Oh, looks like she's smiling,
eh, boss?"

00:11:45.100 --> 00:11:46.467
"So what?" you might say.

00:11:46.467 --> 00:11:48.234
So he has some classified
documents and empty folders.

00:11:48.234 --> 00:11:50.434
Republicans say the difference
is that Hunter Biden

00:11:50.434 --> 00:11:52.968
traded on his name
and connections to make money,

00:11:52.968 --> 00:11:55.567
and surely no one
in the Trump family

00:11:55.567 --> 00:11:56.934
ever did anything like that.

00:11:56.934 --> 00:11:58.300
What? Oh, they did?

00:11:58.300 --> 00:12:01.067
Dudes, come on! Again!
Thank God you said something.

00:12:01.067 --> 00:12:02.501
The next card says,

00:12:02.501 --> 00:12:05.234
"And that's why I'm endorsing
Matt Gaetz as the next president

00:12:05.234 --> 00:12:07.067
of the United States,
because he's right.

00:12:07.067 --> 00:12:08.434
And also,
dudes with large foreheads

00:12:08.434 --> 00:12:10.767
should stick together."

00:12:10.767 --> 00:12:12.334
Wally, you can get rid
of that card, too.

00:12:12.334 --> 00:12:14.767
-Sure, Seth.

00:12:14.767 --> 00:12:16.467
-You're not going
to rip that one?

00:12:16.467 --> 00:12:17.868
-Nah, I'm gonna take it home.

00:12:17.868 --> 00:12:19.667
Need something to cover
the blue light on my phone.

00:12:19.667 --> 00:12:22.601
-Okay.

00:12:22.601 --> 00:12:24.701
Oh, so now we're letting Wally
do callbacks?

00:12:24.701 --> 00:12:26.701
Okay.

00:12:26.701 --> 00:12:28.133
[ Laughter ]

00:12:28.133 --> 00:12:30.801
Anyway, turns out --
and wait for this, shocker --

00:12:30.801 --> 00:12:33.334
the Trump family was allegedly
trading its name

00:12:33.334 --> 00:12:35.868
and connections in a corrupt
deal with the Saudi government.

00:12:35.868 --> 00:12:37.901
-According to a new
Washington Post exposé,

00:12:37.901 --> 00:12:40.067
"The day after leaving
the White House,

00:12:40.067 --> 00:12:42.501
Kushner created a company
that he transformed months

00:12:42.501 --> 00:12:44.501
later into a private equity firm

00:12:44.501 --> 00:12:47.400
with $2 billion
from a sovereign wealth fund

00:12:47.400 --> 00:12:51.067
chaired by Saudi Crown
Prince Mohammed bin Salman."

00:12:51.067 --> 00:12:52.834
And ask for his father-in-law,

00:12:52.834 --> 00:12:54.367
"A year after his presidency,

00:12:54.367 --> 00:12:57.033
Trump's golf courses began
hosting tournaments

00:12:57.033 --> 00:12:59.801
for the Saudi fund-backed
LIV Golf.

00:12:59.801 --> 00:13:01.968
Separately, the former
president's family company,

00:13:01.968 --> 00:13:03.367
the Trump Organization,

00:13:03.367 --> 00:13:05.634
secured an agreement
with a Saudi real estate company

00:13:05.634 --> 00:13:07.534
that plans to build
a Trump hotel

00:13:07.534 --> 00:13:11.300
as part of a $4 billion
golf resort in Oman."

00:13:11.300 --> 00:13:13.367
-Corruption aside, that sounds
like one of the worst vacations

00:13:13.367 --> 00:13:14.434
I could possibly think of.

00:13:14.434 --> 00:13:15.801
"Hey, honey, I know you wanted

00:13:15.801 --> 00:13:17.167
to go to Paris this year,
but great news.

00:13:17.167 --> 00:13:19.200
I got two tickets to
the Trump golf course in Oman.

00:13:19.200 --> 00:13:20.934
We're going in June.
It's gonna be 120 degrees.

00:13:20.934 --> 00:13:22.267
Better get your --

00:13:22.267 --> 00:13:23.567
Honey, you're not
saying anything.

00:13:23.567 --> 00:13:24.734
Do you want to go?"

00:13:24.734 --> 00:13:27.067
-I'm not gonna answer
that question.

00:13:27.067 --> 00:13:28.267
[ Laughter ]

00:13:28.267 --> 00:13:30.534
-Also, Kushner reportedly
started this fund the day

00:13:30.534 --> 00:13:32.033
after he left the White House.

00:13:32.033 --> 00:13:33.601
I'm sorry, it doesn't get
any more corrupt than that.

00:13:33.601 --> 00:13:35.434
He got $2 billion
from the Saudis,

00:13:35.434 --> 00:13:36.634
who he did
official business with

00:13:36.634 --> 00:13:38.033
when he was in the White House.

00:13:38.033 --> 00:13:40.033
And curiously, Republicans
don't seem too concerned.

00:13:40.033 --> 00:13:41.868
The only way we can
get them interested

00:13:41.868 --> 00:13:44.968
is if we take this "Closer Look"
and email a link to Joe Biden,

00:13:44.968 --> 00:13:46.534
asking him to forward it
to his son

00:13:46.534 --> 00:13:47.901
so that the evidence
can be found on --

00:13:47.901 --> 00:13:49.868
-Hunter Biden's laptop.

00:13:49.868 --> 00:13:52.267
-This week alone, we found out
from both the special counsel

00:13:52.267 --> 00:13:54.267
investigating Trump's handling
of classified documents

00:13:54.267 --> 00:13:55.467
and the grand jury looking into

00:13:55.467 --> 00:13:56.734
election interference in Georgia

00:13:56.734 --> 00:13:58.133
that there may be
evidence of crimes,

00:13:58.133 --> 00:14:00.267
but Republicans remain obsessed
with one dude's laptop.

00:14:00.267 --> 00:14:02.367
I have no idea if Trump
will ever get indicted,

00:14:02.367 --> 00:14:04.300
but if the cops
do show up at his house,

00:14:04.300 --> 00:14:05.767
I hope he has
some folders around to --

00:14:05.767 --> 00:14:07.534
-Keep the blue light
out of his eyes.

00:14:07.534 --> 00:14:09.000
This has been "A Closer Look."

00:14:09.000 --> 00:14:12.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

